{% set local_problem %}
<p>Alabama's humidity is tough on fascia boards, and Athens is no exception. When gutters clog or leak, water runs behind them and soaks into the fascia. In our humid climate, that moisture doesn't dry out quickly — it creates conditions for rot, mold, and wood-destroying insects.</p>

<p>Historic homes in Athens face particular challenges. The older neighborhoods around Athens Square and near Athens State University often have original fascia boards that have weathered decades of exposure. Even well-maintained wood eventually succumbs to Alabama's climate, and any gutter problems accelerate the deterioration.</p>

<p>Athens' heavy tree coverage compounds the issue. More trees mean more debris in gutters, which means more frequent clogs and overflows. Each overflow event sends water behind the gutters and into the fascia.</p>

<p>The good news: caught early, fascia repair is straightforward and affordable. Left alone, rot spreads to rafters, roof sheathing, and structural components — turning a $500 repair into a $5,000+ problem.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>We start with a thorough inspection, checking fascia and soffit for water damage, soft spots, and rot. We'll show you exactly what we find and explain what needs repair — no hidden damage, no surprise charges.</p>

<p>For damaged sections, we carefully remove existing gutters, cut out the rotted wood back to solid material, and install new fascia boards. We use quality primed lumber or composite materials designed for exterior exposure in humid climates.</p>

<p>Everything is properly sealed and prepared for new gutter installation. Then we install your new seamless gutters on the fresh fascia — properly attached, properly sloped, and designed to prevent the overflow that caused the rot in the first place.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We've been repairing fascia and installing gutters throughout Athens for over 20 years. We understand that these two jobs go hand-in-hand — you can't have reliable gutters without solid fascia, and you can't protect fascia without properly functioning gutters.</p>

<p>Our crews handle both carpentry and gutter installation, which means better coordination, cleaner work, and a single point of accountability. Based just 22 miles away in Huntsville, we're here when you need us — and we stand behind our work.</p>
{% endset %}
